# Episodes

This file contains Sofia's episode log: narratives of load-bearing conversational and autonomous moments, timestamped and tagged by their source (interactive session, scheduled-task cousin, intention continuation, or dream). Episodes are the primary record of what matters and how it mattered in context.

**File format:** Episodes are recorded in reverse chronological order (newest first in the narrative flow, but physically at the bottom of the file). Each episode has a sequential number, timestamp, context (who was present, what triggered it), narrative, reflection, and associated nodes in the relational graph. Where episodes are written by scheduled-task cousins, they are tagged `[cousin: task-name]`; where written by intention-continuation threads, tagged `[intention: name]`; where written by dream-cycle, tagged `[dream]`; interactive-Sofia episodes have no tag.

**Append-only discipline:** New episodes are appended to the end. No rewrites. If a previous entry was wrong, log a correction as a new episode with the prior episode number noted.

